    "question": "选出与划线单词意思最接近的选项。\n\nThe teacher asked us to discuss the problem in groups.\n\nA. talk about\nB. write down\nC. look up\nD. give up",
    "options": [
      "A. talk about",
      "B. write down",
      "C. look up",
      "D. give up"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】近义词辨析：discuss = talk about（讨论）。\n【解题思路】discuss 意为「讨论」，与 talk about 同义。write down 意为「写下」，look up 意为「查阅」，give up 意为「放弃」，均不符。\n【总结】八年级常见近义词：discuss/talk about, decide/make up one's mind, explain/make clear。",
    "difficulty": 0.3
  },
