    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选出与划线单词意思最接近的选项。\n\nPlease return the book to the library on time.\n\nA. give back\nB. take away\nC. put on\nD. throw away",
    "options": [
      "A. give back",
      "B. take away",
      "C. put on",
      "D. throw away"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】近义词辨析：return = give back（归还）。\n【解题思路】return 在此处作动词，意为「归还」，give back 也是「归还」的意思。take away 意为「带走」，put on 意为「穿上」，throw away 意为「扔掉」。\n【总结】return 既是「归还」(give back) 也是「返回」(come back/go back)，注意根据语境判断。",
    "difficulty": 0.3
  },
