    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选出与划线单词意思最接近的选项。\n\nThe movie was so boring that I almost fell asleep.\n\nA. not interesting\nB. not important\nC. not difficult\nD. not comfortable",
    "options": [
      "A. not interesting",
      "B. not important",
      "C. not difficult",
      "D. not comfortable"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】反义词/近义短语辨析：boring = not interesting（无聊的/乏味的）。\n【解题思路】boring 意为「令人无聊的」，与 not interesting 同义。not important 意为「不重要的」，not difficult 意为「不难的」，not comfortable 意为「不舒服的」。\n【总结】注意区分 boring（令人无聊的）和 bored（感到无聊的）：The movie is boring. I am bored.",
    "difficulty": 0.3
  },
