    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选出与划线单词意思最接近的选项。\n\nThe doctor advised him to give up smoking.\n\nA. stop\nB. keep\nC. enjoy\nD. start",
    "options": [
      "A. stop",
      "B. keep",
      "C. enjoy",
      "D. start"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】近义词辨析：give up = stop（放弃/停止）。\n【解题思路】give up doing sth. 意为「放弃做某事」，与 stop doing sth. 同义。keep doing 意为「继续做」，enjoy doing 意为「喜欢做」，start doing 意为「开始做」。\n【总结】give up/stop/quit 都可以表示「停止做某事」，但 give up 更强调「放弃已经坚持的事物」。",
    "difficulty": 0.3
  },
