      "A. alone",
      "B. along",
      "C. already",
      "D. awake"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】语境选词：lives alone（独自生活）+ doesn't feel lonely（不觉得孤独）。\n【解题思路】lives alone 意为「独自生活」，与后面的 doesn't feel lonely 形成对比。along 意为「沿着」，already 意为「已经」，awake 意为「醒着的」。\n【总结】alone（独自的）≠ lonely（孤独的）。alone 是客观状态，lonely 是主观感受。He lives alone, but he doesn't feel lonely.（他独自生活，但不觉得孤独。）",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
