    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nThe boy _____ his wallet on the bus yesterday.\n\nA. forgot\nB. left\nC. lost\nD. missed",
    "options": [
      "A. forgot",
      "B. left",
      "C. lost",
      "D. missed"
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "analysis": "【考点】语境选词：leave sth. somewhere（把某物落在某处）。\n【解题思路】leave sth. + 地点 表示「把某物落在某处」。forgot 意为「忘记」但不接地点，lost 意为「丢失」，missed 意为「想念/错过」。\n【总结】leave sth. somewhere（把某物忘在某处）是八年级高频考点。注意：不能说 forgot my wallet on the bus，应该说 left my wallet on the bus。",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
