    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nWe should _____ our classroom clean and tidy.\n\nA. keep\nB. make\nC. let\nD. take",
    "options": [
      "A. keep",
      "B. make",
      "C. let",
      "D. take"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】语境选词：keep sth. + 形容词（保持某物……）。\n【解题思路】keep 意为「保持」，keep sth. clean 意为「保持某物干净」。make 也有使役用法（make sth. adj.），但侧重于「使变成」，keep 侧重于「维持」。此处「保持」比「使变成」更恰当。\n【总结】keep + 宾语 + 形容词：keep the room clean, keep your eyes open, keep healthy。",
    "difficulty": 0.3
  },
