    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nMy parents often _____ me not to play computer games too much.\n\nA. hope\nB. wish\nC. advise\nD. let",
    "options": [
      "A. hope",
      "B. wish",
      "C. advise",
      "D. let"
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "analysis": "【考点】语境选词：advise sb. not to do sth.（建议某人不要做某事）。\n【解题思路】四个动词中，只有 advise 可以直接接 sb. not to do sth. 的结构。hope 不能接 sb. to do，wish 虽然可以接 sb. to do 但语义不符（祝愿），let 后接不带 to 的不定式。\n【总结】hope 不接 sb. to do sth.（只能用 hope that...）。advise/tell/want/invite 都可接 sb. (not) to do sth.",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
