    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nIt's very kind _____ you to help me with my English.\n\nA. for\nB. of\nC. to\nD. with",
    "options": [
      "A. for",
      "B. of",
      "C. to",
      "D. with"
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "analysis": "【考点】语境选词：It's kind of sb. to do sth.（某人做某事真好/真善良）。\n【解题思路】当形容词描述的是人的品质（kind, nice, clever, foolish 等）时，用 It's + adj. + of sb. to do sth.。当形容词描述的是事物的特征（important, necessary, difficult 等）时，用 It's + adj. + for sb. to do sth.\n【总结】of：描述人的品质（kind, nice, good, clever, foolish, cruel 等）。for：描述动作的特征（important, necessary, hard, easy 等）。",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
