    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的词形填空。\n\nIt's very _____ outside. You'd better take an umbrella. (rain)\n\nA. rain\nB. raining\nC. rainy\nD. rained",
    "options": [
      "A. rain",
      "B. raining",
      "C. rainy",
      "D. rained"
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "analysis": "【考点】构词法：-y 后缀构成形容词。\n【解题思路】rain + y = rainy（下雨的），作表语描述天气。raining 是现在分词，不能直接作形容词表语。\n【总结】-y 后缀构成形容词：sun→sunny, wind→windy, cloud→cloudy, snow→snowy, fog→foggy, noise→noisy, health→healthy。",
