    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nI remember _____ the door when I left, but now it's open.\n\nA. to close\nB. closing\nC. close\nD. closed",
    "options": [
      "A. to close",
      "B. closing",
      "C. close",
      "D. closed"
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "analysis": "【考点】remember doing sth.（记得做过某事）vs remember to do sth.（记得要做某事）。\n【解题思路】「记得已经关过门了」，动作已经发生，用 remember doing sth.\n【总结】remember doing（记得做过，动作已发生）/ remember to do（记得要做，动作未发生）。类似：forget doing（忘记已做过）/ forget to do（忘记要去做）。",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
  {
    "id": "en_j2_vocab_077",
    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nThe book is _____ interesting _____ everyone wants to read it.\n\nA. so; that\nB. such; that\nC. too; to\nD. enough; that",
    "options": [
      "A. so; that",
      "B. such; that",
      "C. too; to",
      "D. enough; that"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】so...that...（如此……以至于……）\n【解题思路】so + adj./adv. + that 从句。interesting 是形容词，用 so...that。such + (a/an) + adj. + n.。\n【总结】so + adj./adv. + that... / such + (a/an) + adj. + n. + that...。so 修饰形容词/副词，such 修饰名词。",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
