    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nHe is _____ tall _____ reach the apple on the tree.\n\nA. so; that\nB. too; to\nC. enough; to\nD. such; that",
    "options": [
      "A. so; that",
      "B. too; to",
      "C. enough; to",
      "D. such; that"
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "analysis": "【考点】enough to do sth.（足够……可以做某事）。\n【解题思路】「他足够高能够到苹果」，用 enough + adj. + to do sth.。too...to 表示「太……以至于不能」，与句意相反。\n【总结】enough to do sth.（足够做某事）/ too...to do sth.（太……不能做某事）/ so...that...can/can't do sth.（如此……以至于能/不能做某事）。",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
    "id": "en_j2_vocab_079",
    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nHe was _____ tired _____ he fell asleep at his desk.\n\nA. too; to\nB. so; that\nC. enough; to\nD. very; that",
    "options": [
      "A. too; to",
      "B. so; that",
      "C. enough; to",
      "D. very; that"
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "analysis": "【考点】so...that... + 结果从句。\n【解题思路】「他太累了以至于在桌上睡着了」，后面是完整从句（fell asleep），用 so...that。too...to 后接不定式，不接从句。\n【总结】so + adj./adv. + that + 从句（如此……以至于）。注意和 too...to... 的转换：He was so tired that he fell asleep. = He was too tired to stay awake.",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
    "id": "en_j2_vocab_080",
    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "语境选词",
    "ability_tag": "词汇运用",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nThe teacher told us that the earth _____ around the sun.\n\nA. moves\nB. moved\nC. has moved\nD. is moving",
    "options": [
      "A. moves",
      "B. moved",
      "C. has moved",
      "D. is moving"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】宾语从句中的时态：客观真理用一般现在时。\n【解题思路】「地球绕太阳转」是客观真理，即使主句用过去时（told），从句仍用一般现在时（moves）。\n【总结】宾语从句时态规则：主句现在时→从句任意时态；主句过去时→从句相应过去时态。但客观真理例外，永远用一般现在时。",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
  {
    "id": "en_j2_vocab_081",
    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "构词法",
    "ability_tag": "前缀变换",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nIf you don't know the word, you can _____ in the dictionary.\n\nA. look it up\nB. look up it\nC. look for it\nD. look it for",
    "options": [
      "A. look it up",
      "B. look up it",
      "C. look for it",
      "D. look it for"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】动词短语 + 代词的位置。\n【解题思路】look up 是「动副词组」，代词必须放在中间：look it up。look up it 是错误的。look for it 意为「寻找它」，语义不符。\n【总结】动副词组 + 代词：代词放中间。look it up, put it on, take it off, turn it on, give it up, try it on。但名词可放中间也可放后面：look up the word = look the word up。",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
  {
