    "ability_tag": "前缀变换",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nHe _____ to the Great Wall twice.\n\nA. has been\nB. has gone\nC. went\nD. goes",
    "options": [
      "A. has been",
      "B. has gone",
      "C. went",
      "D. goes"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】have been to（去过某地）+ twice（两次）。\n【解题思路】「去了两次」说明已经回来了，用 has been to。has gone to 表示去了还没回来。\n【总结】has been to + 地点（去过，已回）/ has gone to + 地点（去了，未回）。twice, three times 等频度副词常与 has been to 连用。",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
    "id": "en_j2_vocab_087",
    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "构词法",
    "ability_tag": "词根词缀",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\n_____ children there are in a family, _____ their life will be.\n\nA. The fewer; the happier\nB. The less; the happier\nC. The fewer; the more happy\nD. The less; the more happy",
    "options": [
      "A. The fewer; the happier",
      "B. The less; the happier",
      "C. The fewer; the more happy",
      "D. The less; the more happy"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】the + 比较级, the + 比较级（越……越……）\n【解题思路】children 是可数名词复数，用 fewer（更少）。happier 是 happy 的比较级（单音节词加 -er）。\n【总结】the + 比较级, the + 比较级 结构。可数名词用 fewer/more，不可数名词用 less/more。happy→happier（双写辅音字母加 -er 的特例：y 变 i）。",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
  {
    "id": "en_j2_vocab_088",
    "subject": "english",
    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "构词法",
    "ability_tag": "词根词缀",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nOf the two boys, Tom is _____.\n\nA. tall\nB. taller\nC. the taller\nD. the tallest",
    "options": [
      "A. tall",
      "B. taller",
      "C. the taller",
      "D. the tallest"
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "analysis": "【考点】两者之中的较……个用「the + 比较级」。\n【解题思路】「两个男孩中」是明确的两方比较，用 the taller（较高的那个）。不能用最高级，因为只有两个。\n【总结】两者比较用比较级 + the：the taller of the two（两者中较高的）。三者及以上用最高级：the tallest of the three。",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
