    "grade": "junior2",
    "knowledge_tag": "构词法",
    "ability_tag": "词根词缀",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nShanghai is one of _____ cities in China.\n\nA. the biggest\nB. biggest\nC. the bigger\nD. bigger",
    "options": [
      "A. the biggest",
      "B. biggest",
      "C. the bigger",
      "D. bigger"
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "analysis": "【考点】one of the + 最高级 + 复数名词。\n【解题思路】「最……之一」用 one of the + 最高级。最高级前必须加 the。\n【总结】one of the + 最高级 + 复数名词（最……之一）。注意：名词必须用复数形式。One of the best students（最好的学生之一）。",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
  {
