    "knowledge_tag": "构词法",
    "ability_tag": "词根词缀",
    "type": "multiple_choice",
    "question": "选择正确的单词填空。\n\nHe is _____ than any other student in his class. He is the tallest.\n\nA. tall\nB. taller\nC. the tallest\nD. tallest",
    "options": [
      "A. tall",
      "B. taller",
      "C. the tallest",
      "D. tallest"
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "analysis": "【考点】比较级 + than any other + 单数名词（比其他任何……都……）\n【解题思路】「比班里任何其他同学都高」，用比较级 taller。any other 表示排除自身进行比较。\n【总结】比较级句型：比较级 + than + any other + 单数名词。注意必须用 any other（其他任何），不能用 any（那包括了自己）。",
    "difficulty": 0.5
  },
