    "analysis": "【考点】spend time doing sth.（花时间做某事）。\n【解题思路】spend time (in) doing sth. 是固定搭配。take 的句型是 It takes sb. time to do sth.。cost 和 pay 不用于描述花费时间。\n【总结】三个「花费」的区别：① sb. spends time/money on sth. / (in) doing sth. ② It takes sb. time to do sth. ③ sth. costs sb. money.",
