    "analysis": "【考点】so...that... + 结果从句。\n【解题思路】后面是完整句子（he went to bed without eating dinner），用 so...that。too...to 后接不定式短语，不接从句。\n【总结】so + adj./adv. + that + 从句 / such + (a/an) + adj. + n. + that + 从句。too + adj. + to do sth. = so + adj. + that sb. can't do sth.",
    "difficulty": 0.4
  },
